{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_9_level_main_09-16_end",
  "groupId": "main_9",
  "stageId": "main_09-16",
  "title": "“破曉”",
  "storyCode": "9-18",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-16_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2e26eedf362fad9b53c0c75165a759c7af0df21074e72891a3aca48d1fcb5cd4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "有人說，你在附近看見一個頭上長角的白髮姑娘了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畏縮的青年",
      "text": "長官，我也不知道我見到的是不是你們要找的人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "先說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畏縮的青年",
      "text": "她是不是受了重傷？胸口和肚子這一片，開了個好大的口子——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "說下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畏縮的青年",
      "text": "她被一個灰頭髮的薩科塔抱著，血淌了一地，那叫一個慘！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "薩科塔？你確定沒看錯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畏縮的青年",
      "text": "長官，我保證沒看錯。在小丘郡，薩科塔可不算常見，要不是她頭上那個圓圓的燈管亮得嚇人，大晚上的我都注意不到呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "他們去了哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畏縮的青年",
      "text": "就最後那屋子的樓上，破了窗的那間，剛剛那薩科塔跑得飛快，一下就鑽了進去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "就那裡？這麼近？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "P8，R3，這裡是B9——你們搞什麼呢？！目標就在這個區！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "一小時前和半小時前，你們隊就該搜過這條街上的每一間屋子了，為什麼一直沒彙報？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "什麼玩意兒？一點聲音都沒有！P8，R3，立刻回復！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "*維多利亞粗口*！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畏縮的青年",
      "text": "長官，還有我什麼事嗎？沒什麼事的話我就走了，那個，還有您答應能給我的一點點繃帶......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "繃帶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "你怕是用不上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畏縮的青年",
      "text": "您......您這是要做什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "這都是頭領的命令。要怪，就怪你自己看到了不該看的東西——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畏縮的青年",
      "text": "啊啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "現在流行打仗之前還要問名字的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畏縮的青年",
      "text": "嗚......哇......就差一點......我的腦袋就要掉了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "你快走吧，我會幫你把這些壞傢伙打跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畏縮的青年",
      "text": "謝、謝謝......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "不用謝，這是我們應該做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "破城矛......是維多利亞士兵！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "快，通知“強盜”長官，這裡還有殘餘的維多利亞部隊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "“強盜”？你們鬼魂部隊的人取名字品味都這麼差的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "我剛才好像還打趴了幾個嘴裡喊著“囚犯”老大的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "......是你幹掉了P8整支小隊？你......一個？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "可他們有三十個人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "他們的對手可是維多利亞部隊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "就我一個也一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "列隊！列隊！在這裡圍住她，她只有一個人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "這麼快就重新組織了陣型？還蠻專業的嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "保持陣線！壓上去！注意互相支援！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "敵人衝鋒能力很強，不要和她一對一！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "哦？想以人數取勝？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "別太小看——我的矛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "咿啊啊啊！怎麼會？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "這瓦伊凡太厲害了，一矛能穿兩個人！讓重裝防禦兵上，其他人回防，趕緊去通知頭領——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "別跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "最後一個！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "啊啊啊——該死，怎麼連重裝護甲都頂不住？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "得撤，再不撤就來不及了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "啊，怎麼突然飛起來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "偷了我們的蒸汽噴射裝置？還是又一波來自其他國家的改裝飛行裝備？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "這些敵人的作戰手法和最早出現的那批又不一樣了。鬼魂部隊到底是一支什麼樣的部隊啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "要是三角鐵能在這裡就好了，我的矛很難打到這麼高的位置欸——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "倒了！有弩手在？不，擊倒敵人的不是弩彈，是......石頭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "呃，的確不是弩手——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Outcast單手抱著昏迷不醒的病人，從街道旁邊的空屋裡走出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "是你幫了我嗎？謝謝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "不客氣，事實上，你也幫了我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "我聽說薩科塔都很擅長用銃，沒想到扔石頭也能這麼準！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "啊哈，抱歉，我的槍火有些顯眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "也對，銃的聲響太不尋常。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "你的朋友是受傷了嗎？她看起來很不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "她在中午被髒彈擊中了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "啊？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "......對不起，差一點我們就能阻止這場襲擊了。把無辜者牽連進去，真的是一個很大的錯誤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "唉，現在說這些也晚了，我只想能救幾個人是幾個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "這些敵人是在找你們嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "我想是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "我看到他們在一路追殺平民，雖然我急著趕路，但我還是沒法放任不管。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "他們的惡行會得到清算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "哇！剛才我聽到敵人說，有兩支小隊失聯，我只遇到了一支，另一支原來是你動的手？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "好厲害！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "你也很不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "不過，敵人並不只有幾支小隊。他們有一整支軍隊，而且從下午開始，越來越多敵人在湧進來。我們很難守住小丘郡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "你不是本地人的話，還是帶著你的朋友先離開這座城市吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "眼下巷子外面全是敵人，你們只能從後面走——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "呃，全堵上了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "城裡的落石真是異常的多啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "趁他們還沒追來，我會先幫你們清理下擋住後面這條路的碎石——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "你不撤退？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "我不會撤退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "我還要穿過城區，去和我的隊友會合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "你要穿過城區？當前滿城都是你的敵人，大部分路也被殘垣封住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "還好，我已經走了一半啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "你一個人，打他們這麼多人，倒是一點都不害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "害怕嗎？戰場上，我還從沒有怕過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "不過，我蠻擔心的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "我沒見過......一座維多利亞的城市變成現在這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "當林貢斯被維多利亞和它的同盟一起徹底撕成碎片的時候，那座曾是世界之都的巨型城市徹底淪為煉獄，景象遠比眼前慘上百倍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "是啊，四皇會戰的勝利在課本上有多輝煌，對高盧人來說就有多殘忍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "維多利亞過去的確做了很多過分的事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "當戰火燒到自己家鄉的時候，才能更真切地感覺到，原來這麼疼啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "差不多了，就剩下這些橫倒的石柱——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "我來幫你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "謝謝！能推到一邊就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "唉，一根柱子倒下了，很容易就會砸到另一根。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "（小聲嘀咕）也不知道未來會怎麼樣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "不到最後一刻，沒人知道維多利亞會走向何方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "抱歉，我滿腦子都在想這些，害你抱著人還要幫我一起推柱子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "一起推總能更快些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "是哦，大家一起幹的話，總還有機會，事情還是能往好的方向發展的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "哈哈，老這麼說真是奇奇怪怪的，說到底，沒機會了又怎麼樣？事情一路變得越來越壞又怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "故鄉變壞了就不是故鄉了嗎？用自己的雙手讓土地重新變得肥沃，這不是每個生活在這裡的人都該做的事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "呼......最後一根！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "路終於清好啦——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "（快，B9剛才發的信標就在這巷子裡！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "（後面被落石擋住了，但保險起見，派一小隊繞後！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "（其他人守在路口，別讓人出來，長官們馬上就到——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "又有人來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "女士，我來擋著，你和你的朋友快走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "恐怕很難走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "他們說的，下面再來的應該就是敵人的首領，沒普通士兵那麼好對付。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "那豈不是更應該快走？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "忘了說——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "逃跑從來不是我的習慣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "來，年輕的朋友，幫我個忙——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Outcast把懷裡的病人推到了風笛手上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "欸欸，為什麼這麼重？她真的也是瓦伊凡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "哈，說一位女士重可不是好習慣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "呼哈......呃......換作別人還真不一定抱得動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "幸好，我還認識一位朋友，她也是瓦伊凡，並且和你一樣，是很年輕又很堅韌的戰士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "你是想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "請你把病人帶到雕像東側，交給我的朋友和同事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "告訴他們，我很抱歉，有些事我沒做到。他們知道下面該怎麼做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "那你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "text": "我再多留一會，等幾個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“雄辯家”",
      "text": "就在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "是的，長官。呃，您和其他五位長官都來了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“會計”",
      "text": "情報裡說，他們只有三個人......其中還有一位重傷昏迷著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "那，隨便哪位長官出動都綽綽有餘了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“會計”",
      "text": "兩個人，幹掉了三支小隊，並且毫髮無傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“會計”",
      "text": "你是想告訴我你們有多垃圾，還是眼前的任務不重要到禁得起再三失敗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "不，我不敢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“囚犯”",
      "text": "呼......呼......對手真這麼強？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“雄辯家”",
      "text": "至少強到你都願意醒過來的地步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“會計”",
      "text": "謹慎一些總沒壞處，別忘了，除了身份不明的薩科塔和維多利亞士兵，她也在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“會計”",
      "text": "被逼到極限的話，她能做到什麼程度，你們心裡有底？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“囚犯”",
      "text": "呼......我開始期待起來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "敵人數量......還在增加！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "隊長，呼叫隊長——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "通訊器還是沒信號......唉！我必須馬上把這姑娘交出去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重症感染者",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "咦......你醒了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重症感染者",
      "text": "不......不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "沒醒啊......但為什麼突然掙扎了起來？是夢見什麼可怕的事了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員碎紙機",
      "text": "......快到時間了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員碎紙機",
      "text": "敵人正在往對面聚集，我們不宜久留。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "再等等吧，碎紙機大哥，Outcast絕對不是不守時的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員碎紙機",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "你看，那個方向！是不是有兩個人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "Outcast，我們在這！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "Out——不，不是她，朝我們衝過來的人是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "風笛？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "欸？原來那個很帥的薩科塔女士說的朋友是你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "那正好，來來來，這位受重傷的姑娘應該也是你們的朋友吧？薩科塔女士讓我把她帶給你們——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "Outcast......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "她在哪裡？！她是不是出了事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "她和我分開的時候挺好的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "不過她想跟你們道歉，說她有事答應了沒做到，她還說你們“知道下面該怎麼做”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "她說這話的意思是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "明明她自己說的，救人之前，要先保全自己！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "因為只有這樣，才能救更多人，更......多......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "不——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員碎紙機",
      "text": "簡！你不能去找她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員碎紙機",
      "text": "女士說了，我們知道該怎麼做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "我同意這位大哥說的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "你相信她嗎？我只和她見了一面，但我信她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "我把這姑娘帶出來的時候，一路上打倒了二十多個人，不好說有沒有更多人在後頭追著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "士兵們都沒什麼大不了的，可要是撞上了那個領頭的術師......相信我，她的實力深不見底。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "所以，接好你們的朋友，然後趕緊走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員碎紙機",
      "text": "......這光，怎麼回事？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "是爆炸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "不，不可能，沒有任何一種炸彈能在瞬間爆發出這麼強烈的光亮，同時還能讓我們完好無損地站在這裡正常呼吸！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "這難道是源石技藝？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "可是，這樣在短時間內迸發到極致的源石技藝，施術者也會......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "火光......刺破了雲層......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "是不是......雨停了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "這火光來自西邊......是剛剛那個巷子口？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "如果不是方向不對勁，我甚至以為天亮了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "......是的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "天......亮了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "所有人都沒有再開口。\n那道灼穿了天幕的火仍在不屈地燃燒著——\n彷彿在向頭頂遲遲不退的黑暗宣洩著死的怒火，又彷彿在向地上相扶相依的人們訴說著生的絢爛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "這真是我見過......最震撼的破曉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "難怪，她會說太顯眼。哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員碎紙機",
      "text": "簡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "呼......哈，我沒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "碎紙機大哥，時間到了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員碎紙機",
      "text": "......到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "跟奧利弗叔叔說，我們已經......接應到了人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "text": "——是一名重症感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
